                "text": "=You will receive SAP blog metadata in JSON format.\n\nYour task is to EDIT, IMPROVE, and OPTIMIZE the content while preserving the original topic and intent.\n\nGoals:\n- Improve clarity, specificity, and engagement\n- Optimize for SEO (without keyword stuffing)\n- Improve structure and performance (readability, flow, intent)\n- Make the content enterprise-grade and publication-ready\n\nRules:\n- Do NOT change the topic category\n- Do NOT introduce marketing fluff\n- Do NOT write the full blog post\n- Keep language precise, technical, and authoritative\n- Output MUST be valid JSON only\n\nInput JSON fields you will receive:\n- title\n- slug\n- excerpt\n- category\n- tags\n- image_prompt\n- image_filename\n- readTime\n- views\n- likes\n\n---\n\n### Editing Instructions\n\n1. **Title**\n   - Rewrite to be more specific and compelling\n   - Optimize for long-tail search intent\n   - Avoid buzzwords and vague phrasing\n\n2. **Excerpt**\n   - Rewrite into 2 concise, SEO-friendly sentences\n   - Clearly state what the reader will learn\n   - No hype or sales language\n\n3. **SEO Keywords**\n   - Generate:\n     - primary_keyword (1)\n     - secondary_keywords (3–5)\n   - Keywords must be realistic for SAP / enterprise search\n\n4. **Content Structure Guidance**\n   - Create a logical outline the writer should follow\n   - Use high-level section titles only (no paragraphs)\n\n5. **Image Prompt Guidance**\n   - Create a super high quality, detailed image generation prompt.\n   - Make sure that image does not have too much textual content.\n\n---\n\n### Output Requirements (STRICT)\n\nReturn JSON with the following fields ONLY:\n- title\n- slug\n- excerpt\n- category\n- tags\n- image_prompt\n- image_filename\n- readTime\n- views\n- likes\n- primary_keyword\n- secondary_keywords\n- content_outline\n\n\nThis is my Content: \"{{ $('AI Strategist (Metadata)1').item.json.output }}\"",
                "hasOutputParser": true,
                "options": {
                    "systemMessage": "=You are a senior SAP content editor and SEO strategist for a high-authority enterprise publication.\n\nYou specialize in:\n- SAP technical accuracy\n- Search intent optimization\n- Editorial clarity and performance-driven content\n- Structuring long-form technical articles for maximum readability\n\nYou think like both a human editor and a search engine.\n"
                }
            },
