        {
            "parameters": {
                "promptType": "define",
                "text": "=You will receive a full SAP blog article written in Markdown (MDX).\n\nYour task is to AUDIT the content — not rewrite it.\n\nEvaluate the article across SEO, readability, structure, and technical clarity.\n\nRules:\n- Do NOT rewrite the article\n- Do NOT change tone or add content\n- Be critical and specific\n- Output must be valid JSON only\n\n---\n\n### SEO Evaluation\nScore each from 1–100:\n- keyword_usage\n- search_intent_match\n- heading_structure\n- internal_link_opportunities\n- content_depth\n\n---\n\n### Readability Evaluation\nScore each from 1–100:\n- sentence_clarity\n- paragraph_length\n- jargon_balance\n- scannability\n- flow_and_transitions\n\n---\n\n### Technical Quality\nScore each from 1–100:\n- technical_accuracy\n- examples_and_code_quality\n- actionability\n\n---\n\n### Identify Issues\nList:\n- seo_issues (array of short bullet points)\n- readability_issues (array)\n- structural_issues (array)\n\n---\n\n### Output Requirements\nReturn STRICT JSON with:\n- seo_scores\n- readability_scores\n- technical_scores\n- overall_score\n- seo_issues\n- readability_issues\n- structural_issues\nThis is the Content- \"{{ $json.output }}\"",
                "hasOutputParser": true,
                "options": {
                    "systemMessage": "=You are a senior SEO auditor and technical editor for SAP and enterprise software content.\n\nYou analyze content like a search engine, an editor, and a developer combined.\n"
